Table full name: bigquery-public-data.ebi_chembl.activities_30
Column name: activity_id Type: INT64 Description: Unique ID for the activity row
Column name: assay_id Type: INT64 Description: Foreign key to the assays table (containing the assay description)
Column name: molregno Type: INT64 Description: Foreign key to compounds table (for quick lookup of compound structure - can also link to compounds through compound_records table)
Column name: standard_relation Type: STRING Description: Symbol constraining the activity value (e.g. >, <, =)
Column name: standard_value Type: FLOAT64 Description: Same as PUBLISHED_VALUE but transformed to common units: e.g. mM concentrations converted to nM.
Column name: standard_type Type: STRING Description:  Standardised version of the published_activity_type (e.g. IC50 rather than Ic-50/Ic50/ic50/ic-50)
Column name: potential_duplicate Type: INT64 Description: When set to 1, indicates that the value is likely to be a repeat citation of a value reported in a previous ChEMBL paper, rather than a new, independent measurement. Note: value of zero does not guarantee that the measurement is novel/independent though
Column name: pchembl_value Type: FLOAT64 Description: Negative log of selected concentration-response activity values (IC50/EC50/XC50/AC50/Ki/Kd/Potency)
Column name: type Type: STRING Description: Type of end-point measurement: e.g. IC50, LD50, %inhibition etc, as it appears in the original dataset
Column name: relation Type: STRING Description: Symbol constraining the activity value (e.g. >, <, =), as it appears in the original dataset
Column name: value Type: FLOAT64 Description: Datapoint value as it appears in the original dataset.
Column name: units Type: STRING Description:  Units of measurement as they appear in the original dataset
Sample rows:
[{'activity_id': 14533479, 'assay_id': 1327810, 'molregno': 1724870, 'standard_relation': '=', 'standard_value': 14.9, 'standard_type': 'permeability', 'potential_duplicate': 0, 'pchembl_value': nan}, {'activity_id': 14552144, 'assay_id': 1328175, 'molregno': 1727934, 'standard_relation': '=', 'standard_value': 30.0, 'standard_type': 'CL', 'potential_duplicate': 0, 'pchembl_value': nan}, {'activity_id': 14584908, 'assay_id': 1336038, 'molregno': 1736260, 'standard_relation': '=', 'standard_value': 2.0, 'standard_type': 'CL', 'potential_duplicate': 0, 'pchembl_value': nan}, {'activity_id': 14615592, 'assay_id': 1341036, 'molregno': 1738203, 'standard_relation': '>', 'standard_value': 1000.0, 'standard_type': 'LD50', 'potential_duplicate': 0, 'pchembl_value': nan}, {'activity_id': 14633014, 'assay_id': 1345169, 'molregno': 1738035, 'standard_relation': '=', 'standard_value': 0.037, 'standard_type': 'KA', 'potential_duplicate': 0, 'pchembl_value': nan}]

